00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:33.740
That's right.

301
00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:34.540
You were definitely.

302
00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.320
That was what was going on at that time.

303
00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.580
Yeah, you were a new mom.

304
00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:37.820
Yeah.

305
00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.940
It's all such a whirlwind for me.

306
00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:43.920
I think maybe, Jenna, you and I really started working together in the final season.

307
00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.620
Season nine.

308
00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:44.980
Nine.

309
00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:45.400
That's right.

310
00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.020
That's right.

311
00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:46.460
Yeah.

312
00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.920
Well, Jenna, we missed having you on set.

313
00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.800
And I missed, like, what was Pam's outfit for this year?

