00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:03.220
The cast, you know, we had seen your storyline because we would watch the episodes.

318
00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:03.540
Yeah.

319
00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.420
And now we got to be with you.

